From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: netrunner <299844489+plotarmordev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:47:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drama3 metal: EXL3 3.0 routed experts (mul1 trellis)

A layer whose expert tensors carry exllamav3's trellis, suh, svh and mul1 is
EXL3 3.0: gate/up, SwiGLU and down run through core's indexed Metal
projection over the compact router slots. NVFP4 and int3 layers are unchanged.
